OL,3,GNEWSAWoman with memory loss convicted
OL,4,Aover #16 car tax bill
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mother who struggles to walk and talk
OL,7,Fdue to a stroke has been convicted over
OL,8,Fan unpaid #16.67 car tax bill.
OL,10,FThe 47-year-old from Wolverhampton
OL,11,Fsuffered a brain injury following the
OL,12,Fstroke in January 2024 and has since
OL,13,Fexperienced seizures, fatigue and
OL,14,Fmemory loss, according to medical
OL,15,Frecords submitted to Birmingham
OL,16,FMagistrates' Court.
OL,18,FShe faced a prosecution by the Driver
OL,19,Fand Vehicle Licensing Agency (DVLA)
OL,20,Fwhen it spotted that her Honda Civic
OL,21,Fhad not been taxed.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,360,350,200,160,0,100
