OL,3,GNEWSAWoman with memory loss convicted
OL,4,Aover #16 car tax bill
OL,5,
OL,6,FFamily members had offered her help,
OL,7,Fbut the court heard she was
OL,8,F"overwhelmed" by any paperwork she
OL,9,Freceived and often forgot to pass on
OL,10,Fimportant letters to her relatives.
